<title>USA: Prudential names Shulman health care division CEO.</title>
<headline>Prudential names Shulman health care division CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, N.J. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Insurance Co of America said on Tuesday it named Steve Shulman president and chief executive of its health care operations.</p>
<p>Shulman comes to Prudential HealthCare from Value Health Inc, which he co-founded.</p>
<p>Prudential HealthCare, based in Roseland, N.J., operates managed-care health plans with about 4.6 million members nationwide. Through its health and employee-benefit businesses, the unit serves 12 million people, Prudential said.</p>
</text>
